   "text": "No Grafana: vmui and the LogsQL UI are the dashboard layer.\nvmalert is off until an application-level alert needs it; vm-operator is Phase 8b.\nvlagent over Vector or Fluent Bit: several times the throughput at a fraction of the CPU.",
